            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"fantasy-lineup-lab\">Fantasy lineup lab</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Pick a saved forecast, choose your roster (and your opponent's), pick a\ndecision rule and see the lineup it starts, how its total is distributed,\nand whether the call is a near tie. Forecasts come from\n<code>ff.py forecast</code> (an upcoming or replayed week) or the league runs'\ncached weeks.</span></span>"
